# Local fast-feedback gate: run the same guard rails CI enforces before code leaves
# this machine. This mirrors the required `lint-and-typecheck` status check on `main` —
# see docs/FRAMEWORK.md ➜ "Guard rails".
#
# This hook is convenience, not enforcement: it can be bypassed with `git push --no-verify`
# or by never running `npm install`. The non-bypassable gate is the GitHub required status
# check on `main`; this just catches mistakes seconds instead of minutes sooner.

npm run check
